WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.700 --> 00:00:04.151
The Controls panel holds every parameter, in three tabs.

2
00:00:04.151 --> 00:00:05.692
Synth shapes the picture.

3
00:00:06.152 --> 00:00:09.616
I O connects MIDI, audio, OSC, and control voltage.

4
00:00:09.616 --> 00:00:11.110
Help holds the manual.

5
00:00:11.110 --> 00:00:12.061
Back to Synth.

6
00:00:12.514 --> 00:00:14.459
Each tab is a stack of sections.

7
00:00:14.459 --> 00:00:17.378
Click a header to fold a section open or closed.

8
00:00:17.833 --> 00:00:22.136
To find anything fast, press slash, or click the search box, and type.

9
00:00:22.136 --> 00:00:22.504
Bloom.

10
00:00:22.958 --> 00:00:25.236
Drag a knob up or down to change it.

11
00:00:25.236 --> 00:00:27.007
Hold Shift for fine control.

12
00:00:27.007 --> 00:00:28.590
Double-click to reset it.

13
00:00:29.041 --> 00:00:35.633
The small arrow by a knob opens its menu: type an exact value, widen the knob's range, or reset.

14
00:00:36.087 --> 00:00:41.057
The i button on a section header explains it, and draws what is patched into it right now.

15
00:00:41.522 --> 00:00:46.300
Press Escape in the search box to clear it, and everything folds back the way it was.

16
00:00:46.756 --> 00:00:50.148
Next, we will use these controls to shape the raster itself.
